    "status": "present",
    "value": "A board is a grid of cells: 'O' is a robot, 'E' is empty and 'X' is a blocker. For each robot, count how many steps it is from the nearest blocker in each of the four directions (left, up, down, right), where the area just outside the board edge also acts as a blocker. Other robots and empty cells do not block. Given a query of four distances in the order [left, top, bottom, right], return the [row, column] positions of all robots whose four distances match the query exactly, in row-major order."
  },
